    <briefdescription>
<para>The details of a check, displayed when it fails. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Grouped in one object, passed to <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1reporter_1a406cf77b7adcd5fe9417ce7bce4f3afb" kindref="member">reporter::fail()</ref></computeroutput>, so that the call sites do not pass unlabelled Boolean arguments. Held by <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1check__result" kindref="compound">check_result</ref></computeroutput>, and built by <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1test__case" kindref="compound">test_case</ref></computeroutput> when reporting an unexpected exception.</para>
<para>The message is also displayed when the check passes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
